[[1,63,65792,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Disconnect the stop solenoid coil electrical connector.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>GPL cut out solenoid valve</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890759\">L63</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo bolt (2a) and remove coil (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034386.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,65792,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the coil and fix it using the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connector.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>GPL cut out solenoid valve</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890759\">L63</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]